WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
[ YouTube Learning ]

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:05.140
Alright, you’ve now uploaded your first

00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:07.280
video to your YouTube channel and you’d be

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:10.280
very excited to see how your video is doing!

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:12.720
You should know that for your video to do well,

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:14.720
you should ENGAGE with your audience.

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:16.240
And how can you do that?

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:17.360
Let’s see!

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:21.420
[ Don't Memorise intro music ]

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:23.660
The first thing you should do after you upload

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:27.560
your video is share it with as many people as possible.

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:28.560
How do we do that?

00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:32.120
An easy way is to go to YouTube Studio by clicking here,

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:34.460
and then going to the Videos section.

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:37.700
You will see your list of videos here.

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:39.500
Click on the 3 dots next to whichever video

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:42.620
you wish to share and then click on “Get Sharable Link”.

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:44.900
This link is now copied, and you can paste

00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:47.520
it wherever to share it with your students.

00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:48.620
You should share your videos on

00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:50.960
as many platforms as possible:

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:52.260
Google Classroom

00:00:52.380 --> 00:00:55.460
social media pages, your email channels, and so on!

00:00:56.080 --> 00:00:57.860
The more you share your videos,

00:00:57.860 --> 00:01:00.140
the higher your chances of outreach.

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:01.760
After you share your video,

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:03.800
you will also start getting comments on it,

00:01:04.180 --> 00:01:04.880
and it’s important

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:07.540
that you reply to as many comments as you can.

00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:10.000
You can access the comments section by going to

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:13.900
YouTube Studio, and then clicking on Comments here.

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:16.200
By default, you will be able to see the list

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:18.780
of comments, you haven’t responded to.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:21.220
Remember that if your video is made for kids,

00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:23.560
then comments will be turned off for your video

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:24.840
by default.

00:01:24.920 --> 00:01:27.100
Now you could reply to a comment, or give

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:29.280
the comment a heart to show your love!

00:01:29.740 --> 00:01:32.340
When you do that, the person who commented gets a

00:01:32.340 --> 00:01:34.940
notification and that increases engagement on

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:35.940
your channel.

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:39.440
Let’s switch back to the channel view now!

00:01:39.960 --> 00:01:42.480
Another great way to interact with your subscribers

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:43.920
is by going LIVE.

00:01:44.740 --> 00:01:46.840
Remember that in order to go live,

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:48.840
you will first need to go to the channel settings.

00:01:49.760 --> 00:01:50.840
Then we can click on

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:52.380
‘Channel Status and Features’,

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:55.180
and verify your channel by entering your phone number.

00:01:56.280 --> 00:01:58.880
There you go, your account is now verified.

00:01:58.880 --> 00:02:00.990
There’s one more step we need to do!

00:02:00.990 --> 00:02:03.800
We need to go back to the channel settings, Click on

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:06.000
‘Channel Status and Features’ again,

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:08.520
and then enable live streaming.

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:10.620
You should get this message on your screen.

00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:13.600
After 24 hours, you will be able to go live

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:15.000
using your webcam.

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:18.360
Now let me use another account to show you the steps

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:20.780
you need to follow to go live!

00:02:21.220 --> 00:02:23.560
Click on this button in the top right area,

00:02:23.560 --> 00:02:25.320
and then click on ‘Go Live’.

00:02:25.320 --> 00:02:27.220
It will get you to this screen.

00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:29.980
Write a good title that your audience will

00:02:29.980 --> 00:02:32.580
relate to, click on unlisted, and schedule

00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:35.400
it if you wish to go live at a later date.

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:39.140
Once you click on Next, you will then be asked to smile

00:02:39.140 --> 00:02:42.780
for a thumbnail and it will get you to this screen.

00:02:42.780 --> 00:02:45.500
You can also retake the thumbnail if you wish to.

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:48.600
You can then click on Share, and copy the

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:50.120
link you see here.

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:51.620
You can now share this link with all your

00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:53.320
subscribers or students

00:02:53.320 --> 00:02:55.880
and tell them that you will be going live soon.

00:02:56.080 --> 00:02:58.900
This is crucial because your fans or subscribers will be

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:01.540
prepared for your live session in advance.

00:03:01.940 --> 00:03:03.760
They will not only clear their calendar for

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:06.420
your session, but will also keep important questions

00:03:06.420 --> 00:03:07.580
ready for you!

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:10.160
Clicking on Done will show you that your live stream link

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:12.160
is saved, and you can always change

00:03:12.340 --> 00:03:14.320
the date or the thumbnail here by clicking

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:15.720
on this link!

00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:18.500
If you wish to schedule another live stream,

00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:20.960
you could click here and do it.

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:24.160
And YouTube has made it really safe for creators

00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:26.960
to chat with their viewers during the live stream.

00:03:27.180 --> 00:03:30.160
You or a moderator you select can easily moderate

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:31.480
the comments.

00:03:31.820 --> 00:03:33.540
So if any viewer is posting misleading or

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:35.520
inappropriate comments,

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:37.020
then the comment can easily

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:39.940
be removed and the viewer can be blocked as well.

00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:43.480
A couple of interesting things about Live Streaming:

00:03:43.480 --> 00:03:45.560
As we just saw, the Live Streaming through

00:03:45.560 --> 00:03:48.760
webcam is activated only after 24 hours.

00:03:49.860 --> 00:03:52.060
And live streaming through mobile phone will be

00:03:52.060 --> 00:03:54.040
possible only if you have more than

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:56.560
one thousand subscribers on your channel.

00:03:56.980 --> 00:03:58.260
There are a couple of more ways

00:03:58.260 --> 00:04:00.180
to engage with your audience.

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:02.640
When you upload a prerecorded video,

00:04:02.640 --> 00:04:05.600
you have a choice to choose the Premiere option.

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:07.780
This means when your video is launched,

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:10.340
you can watch it with your subscribers and chat

00:04:10.340 --> 00:04:12.320
with them using the chat feature.

00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:15.480
Once you have enough subscribers, you can also use

00:04:15.660 --> 00:04:17.540
your Community Tab and the Stories

00:04:17.720 --> 00:04:19.880
feature to share pictures and videos

00:04:19.880 --> 00:04:20.960
with your fans.

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:22.780
The Community Tab is an engagement tool

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:25.120
you can use to get closer to your subscribers

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:29.100
by sharing images, or GIFs, or even polls for that matter.

00:04:29.100 --> 00:04:31.680
And your subscribers will even get notifications

00:04:31.680 --> 00:04:33.180
for your posts.

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:36.380
YouTube stories, on the other hand, are short,

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:38.540
mobile-only videos that you can share with

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:40.320
your subscribers on the go.

00:04:40.940 --> 00:04:44.320
Each story can have a maximum length of 15 seconds,

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:47.940
and will last only for 7 days and then disappear.

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:51.060
It’s a nice way for your subscribers

00:04:51.060 --> 00:04:52.160
to know you better.

00:04:52.280 --> 00:04:55.320
Note that engaging with your audience is very important

00:04:55.320 --> 00:04:57.600
for your YouTube channel to grow.

00:04:57.600 --> 00:04:58.660
So keep working hard,

00:04:58.660 --> 00:05:00.800
upload good content consistently,

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:01.760
and you will win!

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:02.900
Good luck!

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:11.020
[ #TeachFromAnywhere ]

00:05:11.020 --> 00:05:13.240
[ YouTube Learning ]

